# The movement playground (PLAYER_CONTROLLER.md §9): obstacles near the spawn of the flat test world,
# stamped over it by the controller and netcode tests (core/structure.h; formerly generator
# version 1). Coordinates are world voxels, boxes inclusive; the flat world's grass top is y = −1.
#
# A 1 m block step: needs a jump.
fill -6 0 6   -4 0 8    dwell:stone
# A wall with a 1-wide, 2-tall doorway at x = 0.
fill -2 0 12   2 3 12   dwell:stone
fill  0 0 12   0 1 12   dwell:air
# A crawlspace: a roof 1 m above the floor.
fill  4 1 6    6 1 9    dwell:stone
# A ladder (facing north) up a 4 m wall to a ledge.
fill  8 0 10  10 3 13   dwell:stone
fill  9 0 9    9 3 9    dwell:ladder[facing=north]
# A water pool, 2 m deep.
fill 12 -2 6  15 -1 9   dwell:water
